Signature : pub fn moebius_mu(n: &Integer) -> i8 Description : The Möbius function $\mu(n)$. Parameters : Parameter Type Description n &Integer The input integer Return value : i8. Definition : $$ \mu(n) = \begin{cases} 1 & n = \pm 1 \ (-1)^k & n \text{ has } k \text{ distinct prime factors (square-free)} \ 0 & n \text{ is divisible by the square of a prime} \end{cases} $$ Convention : $\mu(0) = 0$. Example : use ocas_domain::Integer;
