pub struct HilbertSeries { pub numerator: Vec<i64>, pub denominator_power: usize,
} Description : The Hilbert series of the quotient ring $R/I$, represented as the rational function $H(t) = N(t) / (1-t)^n$. The numerator $N(t)$ is stored as a coefficient vector (numerator[i] is the coefficient of $t^i$), and the denominator is $(1-t)^n$ ($n$ is the number of variables). Fields : Field Type Description numerator Vec<i64> Coefficients of the numerator $N(t)$ (starting from the constant term) denominator_power usize Power of $(1-t)$ (= the number of variables $n$)

