Signature : pub fn square_free_factorization(&self) -> SquareFreeFactors<D> Description : Computes the square-free factorization of the polynomial. Returns the distinct square-free factors together with their multiplicities in the original polynomial. Parameters : none (self is the polynomial to factor). Returns : Vec<(DenseUnivariatePolynomial<D>, usize)> — a list of square-free factor and multiplicity pairs. Algorithm : Yun's algorithm (characteristic 0). Let $g = \gcd(f, f')$, $w = f/g$, then iterate $h = \gcd(w, g)$, $z = w/h$ to collect the factors of multiplicity $k$. Example : use ocas_domain::{IntegerDomain, Integer};
use ocas_poly::DenseUnivariatePolynomial; let d = IntegerDomain;
// (x+1)^2 * (x-1) = x^3 + x^2 - x - 1
let p = DenseUnivariatePolynomial::from_coeffs(d, vec![ Integer::from(-1), Integer::from(-1), Integer::from(1), Integer::from(1),
]);
let factors = p.square_free_factorization();
assert_eq!(factors.len(), 2);
